# Supabase Frontend Configuration (Vite / Client-Side)
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY WARNING:
# The Supabase service-role key and database password must NEVER be placed
# in frontend environment files or committed to version control.
# Service-role keys bypass PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) entirely
# and are strictly intended for secure, server-side execution environments
# (such as Supabase Edge Functions).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
